.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# AirX: app/api/data/ and app/api/static/ are COMMITTED on purpose. They are the deploy copies of
# data/ and the built app/web/ dashboard that GitHub Actions uploads to Posit Connect. After changing
# either, run app/api/manifestme.sh and commit app/api/ (manifest.json, data/, static/).
# rsconnect's local deploy record (holds the server address; keep it on your machine)
app/api/rsconnect-python/
node_modules/
dist/
